OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned of delays over     
OL,4,Abrewery tanks convoy                   
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of potential  
OL,7,Fdelays while large brewery tanks are   
OL,8,Fescorted through part of               
OL,9,FNottinghamshire this weekend.          
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said its roads  
OL,12,Fpolicing unit would escort the 28m     
OL,13,F(91.8ft) long load from 08:30 BST on   
OL,14,FSunday.                                
OL,16,FThe load, which measures 5.8m (19ft)   
OL,17,Fwide, will be travelling along the A46,
OL,18,FA616 and A6075 from Brough to Warsop,  
OL,19,Fthe force said.                        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
