OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned of delays over     
OL,4,Abrewery tanks convoy                   
OL,6,FOfficers added it would only be        
OL,7,Ftravelling between 15mph (24km/h) and  
OL,8,F20mph (32km/h) "at best".              
